+/*
+ * ONE LINK FREQUENCY PER MODE.
+ *
+ * Each factory mode carries its own output PLL multiplier
+ * (0x030e/0x030f) and therefore transmits at a different speed:
+ *
+ *     PLL x237 -> 379,2 MHz    9248x6944
+ *     PLL x272 -> 435,2 MHz    3840x2160 y 2312x1304
+ *     PLL x298 -> 476,8 MHz    4624x3472
+ *     PLL x325 -> 520,0 MHz    1920x1080
+ *
+ * The calculation is 19.2 MHz / 3 x mult / 2 (op_sys_div) / 2. Sorted from lowest
+ * to highest because V4L2_CID_LINK_FREQ is a menu and the index is what
+ * CAMSS reads to compute the CSIPHY settle count.
+ *
+ * The device tree has to list them ALL in link-frequencies.
+ */
