+/*
+ * THE CROP RECTANGLE.
+ *
+ * Without this libcamera warns "Unable to get rectangle 0 on pad 0/0" and makes up
+ * that the read area equals the output size. With the binned modes that
+ * is false -2312x1304 comes from a 9248x5216 window- and the field of view
